        "id": 78047,
        "name": "Foote",
        "username": "Foote",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-12-04T21:12:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We have all known who was in the Prime Wardens since Infernal Relics Spiff. 5 members. All shown on Silver Shadow. Sounds like he is giving well known and documented information. If not explicitly confirmed already, it has been a major consensus for a long while way before Vengeance PTing. And if he thinks he knows that Thorathians name, well, I am missing the leaked information there.&nbsp;</p><p>And Spiff, calling for the Ban Hammer on someone unnessesarily is not equally rude? Let's stick to the subject at hand. This is not about me dude. (Not saying I don't agree with you to a point, however. Don't get me wrong there).</p><p>He isn't leaking as much as you'd like to think he is.&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 71,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:59:14.620Z",
