      {
        "id": 78049,
        "name": "Foote",
        "username": "Foote",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-12-04T21:32:03.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>My contention isn't that he didnt leak anything of conseqence. My contention is that he didn't leak anything period. This comes down to an argument about whether him saying he thinks he knows the name of an unreleased character should be classified as \"leaking information\". We are just going to have to agree to disagree there mate.</p>",
