      {
        "id": 78050,
        "name": "Christopher",
        "username": "Christopher",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/christopher/{size}/1851_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-12-04T21:38:19.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hey! There are a few of us who can ban McBehrer, and it's none of the people in this discussion! (Well, up until now...)</p><p>The people who CAN ban people are paying attention to everything, and have talked to individuals before about their posting habits (*ahem - keep it under control, kid*) but, either way, it's not your decision. It's the decision of those elusive few who do actually weild the ban hammer. Who are they? The Multiverse may never know. It is said they are perpetually cloaked in shadow and that they live in an unfindable cave on the top of an unclimbable mountain, deep in an unknowable forest, surrounded by an uncrossable river...</p><p>But, then again, manything are said, and that's probably a pile of nonsense. Pfft. Surely there is no secret mastermind who pulls all the strings...</p><p>As you were, citizens.</p>",
        "post_number": 74,
