        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mcbehrer/{size}/1850_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-12-04T22:23:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Well, it's pretty obvious the Thorathian is not the bearded guy with the energy stuff, who IS the other Prime Warden probably.</p><p>Also, to correct Spiff, they WERE fairly consistent. That was more of a speculation, and a pretty small one at that, but I haven't seriously leaked anything in a while; not since we talked, at any rate.</p>",
